# paperweight (Framework 16, Arch) — YubiKey 5 Nano, serial 38056180
# Public halves of resident FIDO2 credentials. Safe to commit.
#
# Serial 38056180 replaced 16946249 on 2026-09-03 (see git/allowed_signers).
# The old token — and its `ssh:github` credential — moved to minimini, so that
# key is listed in minimini.pub, not here. paperweight still carries a stale
# ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_sk stub for it that can never sign; see yubikey-ssh.md.
#
# ssh:tailnet — minted 0x20 (no touch, no PIN) for unattended agent sessions.
# Deployed as ~/.ssh/id_ed25519_sk_tailnet. Deliberately NOT registered on
# GitHub, matching ssh:chonky-notouch and ssh:minimini-notouch.
#
# This is paperweight's ONLY auth credential — there is no touch-required
# fallback here the way chonky and minimini have one.
no-touch-required sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAAGnNrLXNzaC1lZDI1NTE5QG9wZW5zc2guY29tAAAAIC7uQ9i1z00BqD/HLcUTqZaUZ9lR26f7RHmIAPngUdjqAAAAC3NzaDp0YWlsbmV0 tailnet (paperweight)
